<title>USA: N.Y. CERT COTTON STOCKS DROP 528 BALES TO 94,339.</title>
<headline>N.Y. CERT COTTON STOCKS DROP 528 BALES TO 94,339.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of Aug 11 totaled 94,339 bales, down from 94,867 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were no bales issued, no bales awaiting review, 528 cancellations, and 991 decertification orders. ((New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640))</p>
